CircuitSim 3D --- AI Electronics Simulator

1. Project Vision

Build an open-source, browser-based AI-assisted 3D electronics
simulator where users can physically assemble virtual electronic
circuits instead of working only with abstract schematic nodes.

The experience should feel like a combination of:

A real electronics workbench

A breadboard simulator

A PCB/component design tool

An MCU/firmware simulator

A digital logic/CPU simulator

An AI engineering assistant

The key requirement is:

The circuit should look and behave like a real physical electronics
setup, while the underlying system remains a structured,
machine-readable simulation model.

