9. Simulation Architecture

The 3D renderer must NOT be responsible for the actual electrical
simulation.

Use separate layers:

                         AI AGENT
                            │
                     Tool / MCP Layer
                            │
              ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
              │             │             │
              ▼             ▼             ▼
        Circuit Model   Firmware Model   Component DB
              │             │             │
              ▼             ▼             ▼
        Circuit Engine    MCU Engine    3D Assets
              │             │             │
              └─────────────┼─────────────┘
                            ▼
                     Simulation State
                            │
                            ▼
                      3D Renderer

The 3D scene is a visual representation of the simulation state.

