17. AI Debugging

If a circuit does not work:

User:
"The BME280 isn't responding."

AI should inspect:

Power
  ↓
Voltage
  ↓
Ground
  ↓
I2C wiring
  ↓
I2C address
  ↓
Firmware
  ↓
MCU peripheral
  ↓
Simulation model

Then provide evidence:

BME280 VCC = 0.0 V

Expected = 3.3 V

Problem:
BME280 is not connected to the 3.3 V rail.

The AI should not simply guess.

