32. Important Design Principle

The AI should not have direct uncontrolled access to the simulation
state.

Use explicit tools:

AI
 │
 ├── read_project
 ├── inspect_circuit
 ├── create_component
 ├── connect
 ├── simulate
 ├── inspect_signal
 ├── compile
 ├── flash
 └── debug

Every modification should produce an operation that can be:

previewed
validated
accepted
undone
logged

This makes the AI agent safer and easier to debug.

